  "title": "Bean Soup with Kale",
  "description": "This white bean and kale soup is simple to make with creamy cannellini beans in a rich tomato and garlic broth for a nourishing homemade meal.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Jean Carper"
