      ],
      "image": "assets/images/78023/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium-high heat. Cook and stir onion and garlic in hot oil until soft.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m-ZrfhWgY7JaawQS3nbzZsiYdhM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/78023-BeanSoupWithKale-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-3193-99dcb93fdda4437e9f818cadf11c4016.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/78023/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add kale; cook and stir until wilted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/obWUaYWKvQnNPuknCW3xz2eo8kI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/78023-BeanSoupWithKale-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-3198-286491722512401cb594384bbae27165.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/78023/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 3 cups broth, 2 cups beans, tomatoes, herb seasoning, salt, and pepper; bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OYEnjh3Mugdqj8FZ2K4KTmLRZjk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/78023-BeanSoupWithKale-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-3199-9d487794fb6a43d1b19b3751211e46e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/78023/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix remaining beans and broth in a blender or food processor until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cenO3pvZwAGi5rEYtcJbFtvplA0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/78023-BeanSoupWithKale-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-3201-c8a65014053141d5b2f76b24748d6d38.jpg"
